# Packages Rules (`packages/**`)

| Package | Role |
|---------|------|
| `@elynd/db` | Drizzle schemas + `setupDb()` |
| `@elynd/shared` | Shared Zod schemas / types |
| `@elynd/tsconfig` | Shareable TS presets only (no app `paths`) |
| `@elynd/eslint-config` | Shareable ESLint flat configs |
| `@elynd/prettier-config` | Shareable Prettier config |

## TypeScript

- Libraries extend `@elynd/tsconfig/library.json`
- Keep `outDir` / `rootDir` / `include` / `exclude` local
- Cross-package imports use workspace names (`@elynd/db`), not relative paths across packages
- Package-internal relative imports are fine

## Do not

- Put app aliases (`@/*`) into `@elynd/tsconfig`
- Publish secrets or environment-specific compose overrides into these packages
